{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":16577694,"ns":0,"title":"Alpha beta filter","extract":"An alpha beta filter (also called alpha-beta filter, f-g filter or g-h filter) is a simplified form of observer for estimation, data smoothing and control applications. It is closely related to Kalman filters and to linear state observers used in control theory.","description":"Predictive filter","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}